  "description": "Obex, Osero, Grove, Pattern and Skybase all inherit Total Risk Capital requirements as a live base class, with modifications propagating automatically into the Agent's Artifact. Binding content change",
  "orientation": "Obex, Osero, Grove, Pattern and Skybase all inherit Total Risk Capital requirements as a live base class, with modifications propagating automatically into the Agent's Artifact. Binding content changes with no proposal, no alignment review and no token-holder vote \u2014 routing around the Root Edit process that supposedly governs all Artifact change. Every Instance declares 'No customization presently', so the operative logic governing an Agent's programme lives in a Core Atlas document its own holders never vote on.",
